# The build context for demo/Dockerfile, which is built from the repository root. Everything is left
# out except what the Dockerfile copies: the lock, the package source with the files its build reads
# (pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE), and the demo page. So .git, .venv, the notebooks and their
# outputs, out/ folders, dist/ and every cache stay out of the context and out of the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements-lock.txt
!src/
!demo/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
